# The build context is sent to the daemon in full. data/ holds the downloads and
# the graph -- tens of gigabytes after a national run -- and none of it belongs in
# an image. The glob as well as the bare name: each region gets its own data root,
# so data-gb/ and data-london/ were being sent when only `data/` was listed.
data/
data-*/
*.pmtiles
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.osm.pbf
*.part

# Patterns match the whole path and do not recurse on their own, so a bare
# `__pycache__/` excludes the root one and leaves wayfare/__pycache__/ in the
# context -- where `COPY wayfare` puts it in the image and invalidates that layer.
# Hence the `**/` on everything that can appear at depth.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.egg-info/
.git/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Claude Code's session state, and the git worktrees it creates under here --
# each one a repository copy carrying its own .venv.
.claude/

.env
.DS_Store
